# Walking a text by its units (strings.md): str.each.byte / .point /
# .grapheme — 21 bytes, 8 points, 6 clusters for "aé" ++ "เกี่ยว"; each
# cluster a text of its own, given back with the walk.
extern fn exit ['code': int32];
extern fn getenv ['name': ptr[uint8]] -> ptr[uint8];
MAIN {
    'k' := "CCA_SURELY_UNSET_VARIABLE";
    nocheck 'there' := ptr.is_null[getenv[lend 'k']];
    mut 's' := "ab";
    if 'there' { change 's' = "aé" ++ "เกี่ยว"; }
    mut 'bytes': int32 = 0;
    for 'b' in str.each.byte[lend 's'] { change 'bytes' = 'bytes' + 1; }
    mut 'points': int32 = 0;
    mut 'codes': int64 = 0;
    for 'p' in str.each.point[lend 's'] { change 'points' = 'points' + 1; change 'codes' = 'codes' + to.int64[char.code['p']]; }
    mut 'clusters': int32 = 0;
    mut 'last' := "";
    for 'g' in str.each.grapheme[lend 's'] { change 'clusters' = 'clusters' + 1; change 'last' = to.str.utf8['g']; }
    mut 'got': int32 = 0;
    if 'bytes' == 21 and 'points' == 8 { change 'got' = 'got' + 1; }
    if 'codes' == 97 + 233 + 3648 + 3585 + 3637 + 3656 + 3618 + 3623 { change 'got' = 'got' + 2; }
    if 'clusters' == 6 and 'last' == "ว" { change 'got' = 'got' + 4; }
    nocheck exit['got'];
}
